{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o020b","title":"李傕郭汜杀王允逐吕布","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o020b-account","label":"正文","text":"李傕、郭汜等杀王允、攻吕布，吕布败走武关，李傕等专擅朝政。","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o018a-account","label":"《董二袁刘传第六》正文","text":"李傕等掠长安杀王允","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o018a-q"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-8185ab210b9f7fae0a87","label":"正文","text":"布畏恶凉州人李傕等相结还攻长安入城布败","evidence":["lvzang-q-86a9da88a7cd4139953d"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0089","role":"攻杀执政","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0090","role":"攻杀执政","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0087","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"败走","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]}],"place":{"text":"武关","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q"]},"time":{"label":"初平三年","year":192,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o020b-q","wudi-q-o019","wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415"],"chronology":"wudi-y192","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o019","basis":"初平三年","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,161,"O020b"],"order":79}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0087","name":"王允","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0089","name":"李傕","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0090","name":"郭汜","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o018a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-03f807b91941fde0ac22","layer":"original","quote":"傕等放兵，略长安老少，杀之悉尽，死者狼藉。诛杀卓者，尸王允于市〖4〗。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":129,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lvzang-q-86a9da88a7cd4139953d","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-6b26ec8fa6750113614d","layer":"original","quote":"布自杀卓后，畏恶凉州人。凉州人皆怨，由是李傕等遂相结，还攻长安城。﹝一﹞布不能拒，傕等遂入长安。卓死后六旬，布亦败","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":32,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o020b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-cdac46ba3c53b50c81e1","layer":"original","quote":"卓将李傕、郭汜等〖2〗，杀允攻布。布败，东出武关。傕等擅朝政。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-3863a19b555811d1f415","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3863a19b555811d1f415","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗三年：初平三年（公元 192）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2063caf2b642ce9ff2bc","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o019","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620706e925cc9a268c","layer":"original","quote":"三年春〖1〗，太祖军顿丘，毒等攻东武阳。太祖乃引兵西入山，攻毒等本屯〖2〗。﹝一﹞毒闻之，弃武阳还〖3〗。太祖要击眭固〖4〗，又击匈奴于夫罗于内黄〖5〗，皆大破之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
